# Unreal Engine C++ project
# Keep source assets and project files: *.uproject, Source/, Config/, Content/, Plugins/*/Source, *.uasset, *.umap
# Ignore generated build files, local caches, IDE state, logs, packaged builds, and local captures.

# Unreal build outputs and generated folders
Binaries/
Intermediate/
Saved/
DerivedDataCache/
/Script/

# Plugin generated folders
Plugins/**/Binaries/
Plugins/**/Intermediate/
Plugins/**/Saved/
Plugins/**/DerivedDataCache/

# Local marketplace/imported asset packs
/Plugins/
/Content/AnimatedLightFunctions/
/Content/DARK_C_KNIGHT/
/Content/DetectiveOffice/
/Content/HistoricalMueseum/
/Content/Mabushii/
/Content/QuestSystem/
/Content/QuestSystem_Notebook/

# Build folder: ignore generated build content, but keep useful project metadata/icons/blacklists
# 하위 폴더를 먼저 되살려야(!/Build/**/) git이 안쪽까지 내려가서 아래 예외가 동작한다
/Build/**
!/Build/**/
!/Build/**/*.ico
!/Build/**/PakBlacklist*.txt

# Packaged builds / staged outputs
# 반드시 루트 한정(/)으로 둔다 — 앵커가 없으면 Config/Windows, Config/Android 같은
# 플랫폼별 설정 폴더까지 무시되어 커밋에서 조용히 빠진다
/Releases/
/Packaged/
/StagedBuilds/
/Windows/
/WindowsNoEditor/
/Linux/
/LinuxNoEditor/
/Mac/
/MacNoEditor/
/Android/
/IOS/

# Unreal generated project files
*.sln
*.suo
*.opensdf
*.sdf
*.VC.db
*.VC.opendb
*.xcodeproj
*.xcworkspace
*.code-workspace

# Visual Studio / Rider / VS Code local state
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
.Rider/
*.user
*.userosscache
*.rsuser
*.DotSettings.user

# CMake / compile database outputs
CMakeFiles/
CMakeCache.txt
cmake-build-*/
compile_commands.json

# Compiler and linker outputs
*.slo
*.lo
*.o
*.obj
*.gch
*.pch
*.so
*.dylib
*.dll
*.mod
*.lai
*.la
*.a
*.lib
*.exe
*.out
*.app
*.ipa
*.pdb
*.ilk
*.ipch
*.iobj
*.ipdb
*.tlog
*.lastbuildstate

# Common local build configuration folders
# 루트 한정 — 앵커가 없으면 Source/ThirdParty/**/x64/ 같은 정상 경로까지 먹는다
# (Binaries/, Intermediate/ 안의 빌드 산출물은 위에서 이미 무시된다)
/Debug/
/DebugGame/
/Development/
/Shipping/
/x64/
/x86/
/Win32/
/Win64/

# .NET / Unreal Build Tool generated artifacts
obj/
bin/
*.csproj
*.vbproj
*.fsproj
*.nupkg

# Logs, temporary files, and editor backups
*.log
*.tmp
*.temp
*.bak
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# Built data and source art exports that can be regenerated
*_BuiltData.uasset
SourceArt/**/*.png
SourceArt/**/*.tga

# Crash reports and profiling captures
Crashes/
Profiling/
*.ue4stats
*.uestats
*.utrace
*.ucas.tmp
*.utoc.tmp

# Large local-only media captures
*.avi
*.mp4
*.mov
*.mkv

# OS files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini

# 로컬 에이전트 설정 (개인 PC 전용 — 공유하지 않는다)
.claude/settings.local.json

# NOTE: 여기에 !*.uasset / !*.umap 같은 "명시적 유지" 예외를 다시 넣지 말 것.
# gitignore는 마지막 매치가 이기므로, 그 예외가 위쪽의 *_BuiltData.uasset 규칙을
# 무효화해서 라이트맵 빌드 데이터(수백 MB, 빌드마다 전체 변경)가 커밋된다.
# Source/, Config/, Content/, *.uproject 는 애초에 무시된 적이 없어 예외가 필요 없다.
